{"seq":1,"slug":"internal-account-chart","title":"内部账户与科目体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/double-entry-ledger-platform/account-chart-model/internal-account-chart","wordCount":2568,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"内部账户与科目体系\">内部账户与科目体系</h1><p>在账本里写下第一笔分录之前，必须先决定&quot;钱记在哪个格子里&quot;。这个格子体系由两层组成：<strong>科目（chart of accounts）</strong> 是会计语义的分类，回答&quot;这是什么性质的钱&quot;；<strong>账户（account）</strong> 是记账主体，回答&quot;这笔钱现在归谁、在哪个环节&quot;。工程上常把二者合并成一张表，但只要出现&quot;同一科目的多个主体&quot;（比如一万个商户都各有一个&quot;应付商户款&quot;户），就必须把它们拆开，否则科目表会被主体数量撑爆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-五个会计要素与借贷方向\">核心概念：五个会计要素与借贷方向</h2><p>所有科目最终归入五个要素，这是复式记账的语义基础。少一个都无法自洽：如果只有资产和负债，就记不了平台赚的手续费去哪了。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>英文</th>\n<th>增加方向</th>\n<th>平台内的典型科目</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>资产</td>\n<td>Asset</td>\n<td>借方增加</td>\n<td>银行存款、渠道备付金、应收手续费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负债</td>\n<td>Liability</td>\n<td>贷方增加</td>\n<td>应付商户款、用户钱包余额、预收款项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>所有者权益</td>\n<td>Equity</td>\n<td>贷方增加</td>\n<td>实收资本、未分配利润</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收入</td>\n<td>Revenue</td>\n<td>贷方增加</td>\n<td>支付手续费收入、技术服务费收入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>费用</td>\n<td>Expense</td>\n<td>借方增加</td>\n<td>渠道成本、汇兑损益、坏账损失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"借贷不是借出借入\">借贷不是借出借入</h3><p>借贷不是&quot;借出/借入&quot;的日常语义，而是两个纯粹的记账方向符号。判定的捷径是会计恒等式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>资产</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>费用</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>负债</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>所有者权益</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>收入</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{资产} + \\text{费用} = \\text{负债} + \\text{所有者权益} + \\text{收入}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">资产</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">费用</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">负债</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">所有者权益</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">收入</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>等号左边增加记借方，右边增加记贷方。这条恒等式也是第三章试算平衡的理论来源——把全部科目的借方合计与贷方合计相减，永远应得零，因为每一笔分录都同时在两侧加了等额。反过来，如果账本某处出现了不平衡，说明有分录被破坏或被绕过，这是 <a href=\"../balance-trial-balance/trial-balance-check\">试算平衡与自检</a> 要自动发现的事。</p>\n<p>用户钱包余额挂在<strong>负债</strong>而非资产下，这一点常被写错。用户充值的钱确实进了平台的银行账户（资产增加），但平台同时欠用户等额的钱（负债增加）。把它记成资产会导致平台把不属于自己的钱算成自己的收入，这是严重的会计错误。</p>\n<h3 id=\"恒等式为什么必然成立\">恒等式为什么必然成立</h3><p>恒等式的成立不是巧合，而是复式记账的定义性后果。每一笔分录都同时在等号两侧加上等额：记一笔&quot;借 银行 100 / 贷 应付商户 100&quot;，左侧资产加 100、右侧负债加 100，等式仍成立。记一笔&quot;借 费用 50 / 贷 银行 50&quot;，左侧&quot;资产 + 费用&quot;净变化为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-50 + 50 = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，右侧不变，等式仍成立。数学上可以把账簿每个账户的余额写成带符号的代数和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>accounts</mtext></mrow></munder><mtext>sgn</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>balance</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>sgn</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>normal_side</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>normal_side</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{a \\in \\text{accounts}} \\text{sgn}(a) \\cdot \\text{balance}(a) = 0, \\qquad \\text{sgn}(a) = \\begin{cases} +1 &amp; a.\\text{normal\\_side} = DR \\\\ -1 &amp; a.\\text{normal\\_side} = CR \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3274em;vertical-align:-1.2774em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">accounts</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sgn</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">balance</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sgn</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">normal_side</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">normal_side</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子是本 hub 第三章 <a href=\"../balance-trial-balance/trial-balance-check\">试算平衡与自检</a> 要自动验证的目标——它是账本唯一一个全局不变量，任何本地的校验都无法替代它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"科目编码与科目树\">科目编码与科目树</h2><h3 id=\"分段编码的三个好处\">分段编码的三个好处</h3><p>科目需要一套稳定编码，因为编码会出现在分录、报表、对账文件与监管报送中，一旦生成就几乎不可能改。常见的工程做法是分段编码，让编码本身携带层级信息而无需求递归查询：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"1000            资产类（一级）&#10;1001            银行存款&#10;1001.01         银行存款 - 招商银行基本户&#10;1001.02         银行存款 - 汇丰香港户&#10;2000            负债类（一级）&#10;2001            应付商户款&#10;2001.01         应付商户款 - 待结算&#10;2001.02         应付商户款 - 结算在途&#10;4000            收入类&#10;4001            支付手续费收入\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>1000            资产类（一级）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1001            银行存款</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1001.01         银行存款 - 招商银行基本户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1001.02         银行存款 - 汇丰香港户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2000            负债类（一级）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2001            应付商户款</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2001.01         应付商户款 - 待结算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2001.02         应付商户款 - 结算在途</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4000            收入类</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4001            支付手续费收入</span></span></code></pre></div><p>分段编码带来三个具体好处：一是报表按前缀聚合时可以直接用 <code>LIKE &#39;1001%&#39;</code> 或范围扫描走索引，不必做递归 CTE；二是权限可以按前缀授予（只给财务看 <code>1001*</code>）；三是科目树的深度固定，不会出现&quot;某个科目被挂到任意深度&quot;导致汇总逻辑不一致。</p>\n<p>不过分段编码也有代价：<strong>科目不能随意新增中间层</strong>。如果 <code>1001.01</code> 下想再插一层，就得改成 <code>1001.01.01</code>，而已经上线的分录引用的是旧编码。因此实务上会保留一个 <code>parent_code</code> 字段做可变的层级关系，把编码只当作稳定的外部标识，两者并存而不是互相推导。这种&quot;编码给外部用、父子关系给内部用&quot;的双轨设计，在处理&quot;科目重组但历史分录不能动&quot;时是必要的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"科目表的-ddl\">科目表的 DDL</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE chart_of_accounts (&#10;  code           VARCHAR(32)  PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  parent_code    VARCHAR(32)  REFERENCES chart_of_accounts(code),&#10;  name_zh        VARCHAR(128) NOT NULL,&#10;  element        VARCHAR(16)  NOT NULL&#10;                 CHECK (element IN (&#39;ASSET&#39;,&#39;LIABILITY&#39;,&#39;EQUITY&#39;,&#39;REVENUE&#39;,&#39;EXPENSE&#39;)),&#10;  normal_side    CHAR(2)      NOT NULL CHECK (normal_side IN (&#39;DR&#39;,&#39;CR&#39;)),&#10;  is_leaf        BOOLEAN      NOT NULL DEFAULT TRUE,&#10;  created_at     TIMESTAMPTZ  NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_coa_parent ON chart_of_accounts(parent_code);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> chart_of_accounts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  code           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  parent_code    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chart_of_accounts(code),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name_zh        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  element        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                 CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (element </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ASSET'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'LIABILITY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'EQUITY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'REVENUE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'EXPENSE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  normal_side    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (normal_side </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  is_leaf        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TRUE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_coa_parent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chart_of_accounts(parent_code);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>normal_side</code> 记录科目的&quot;正常余额方向&quot;，它不是冗余字段：判断一个账户是否异常（比如资产科目出现贷方余额）需要它，报表的符号约定也依赖它，而 <code>element</code> 到方向的映射虽然理论固定，但允许覆盖能处理累计折旧这类特例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平台内部账户清单\">平台内部账户清单</h2><h3 id=\"为什么必须有内部账户\">为什么必须有内部账户</h3><p>一个电商支付平台的账本，除了面向用户的账户，还必须有一组<strong>平台内部账户</strong>，它们承担&quot;钱在流转途中暂存&quot;的职责。没有这组账户，交易就无法在复式框架内表达——因为&quot;钱从用户到商户&quot;中间必然存在一段时间差，这段时间差必须有归属。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  U[用户钱包户&lt;br/&gt;负债] --&gt;|支付 100| P[渠道清算在途户&lt;br/&gt;资产]&#10;  P --&gt;|清算完成| B[银行存款户&lt;br/&gt;资产]&#10;  B --&gt;|确认收入| F[手续费收入户&lt;br/&gt;收入]&#10;  B --&gt;|应付确认| M[应付商户款户&lt;br/&gt;负债]&#10;  M --&gt;|结算打款| O[商户银行账户&lt;br/&gt;账外]\">graph LR\n  U[用户钱包户&lt;br/&gt;负债] --&gt;|支付 100| P[渠道清算在途户&lt;br/&gt;资产]\n  P --&gt;|清算完成| B[银行存款户&lt;br/&gt;资产]\n  B --&gt;|确认收入| F[手续费收入户&lt;br/&gt;收入]\n  B --&gt;|应付确认| M[应付商户款户&lt;br/&gt;负债]\n  M --&gt;|结算打款| O[商户银行账户&lt;br/&gt;账外]</pre><p>逐个说明这组账户为什么必须存在：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>渠道清算在途户（资产）</strong>：用户支付后、渠道清算到银行前，这笔钱已经属于平台但还没到账。挂在在途户上，资产总额与银行对账单的差额就有了明确解释。</li>\n<li><strong>手续费收入户（收入）</strong>：平台从交易中抽取的部分。它的存在保证了&quot;收入&quot;不在分录里被直接冲减资产。</li>\n<li><strong>应付商户款户（负债）</strong>：平台代收的、尚欠商户的钱。每个商户一个子账户，科目相同而主体不同——这正是科目与账户必须分离的直接理由。</li>\n<li><strong>平台自有资金户（资产）</strong>：平台自己的本金，用于垫付退款等场景。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"一组完整分录的落库形式\">一组完整分录的落库形式</h3><p>把这组账户画成一条资金流，可以看到每一跳都是一对借贷。用户支付 100 元、平台收 1 元手续费，资金进入平台银行户：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 业务：用户支付 100.00 元（最小币种单位=分），平台手续费 1.00 元&#10;INSERT INTO journal_entry (entry_id, biz_ref, posted_at, currency)&#10;VALUES (&#39;E20260927001&#39;, &#39;ORDER-8871&#39;, &#39;2026-09-27T10:00:00Z&#39;, &#39;CNY&#39;);&#10;&#10;INSERT INTO journal_line (entry_id, account_id, direction, amount_minor) VALUES&#10;  (&#39;E20260927001&#39;, &#39;ACC_BANK_MAIN&#39;,        &#39;DR&#39;, 10000),  -- 资产增加&#10;  (&#39;E20260927001&#39;, &#39;ACC_PAYABLE_MERCHANT_M77&#39;, &#39;CR&#39;,  9900),  -- 负债增加&#10;  (&#39;E20260927001&#39;, &#39;ACC_FEE_REVENUE&#39;,      &#39;CR&#39;,   100);  -- 收入增加\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 业务：用户支付 100.00 元（最小币种单位=分），平台手续费 1.00 元</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_entry (entry_id, biz_ref, posted_at, currency)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'E20260927001'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ORDER-8871'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-09-27T10:00:00Z'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CNY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_line (entry_id, account_id, direction, amount_minor) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'E20260927001'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ACC_BANK_MAIN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 资产增加</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'E20260927001'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ACC_PAYABLE_MERCHANT_M77'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9900</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 负债增加</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'E20260927001'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ACC_FEE_REVENUE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 收入增加</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三行合计借方 10000，贷方 9900 + 100 = 10000，平衡。这里没有用户钱包户的参与，因为用户的资金在支付前就已经在渠道侧；若用户用的是平台内钱包余额直接扣减，则贷方会变成用户钱包（负债减少），方向相应变化——<strong>这就是方向规则必须精确化的原因</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个账户里的借贷方向如何确定\">一个账户里的借贷方向如何确定</h2><h3 id=\"四种组合穷尽\">四种组合穷尽</h3><p>方向由&quot;科目所属要素&quot;与&quot;变动方向&quot;两个变量共同决定，四种组合穷尽如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>科目要素</th>\n<th>金额增加</th>\n<th>金额减少</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>资产</td>\n<td>借（DR）</td>\n<td>贷（CR）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负债</td>\n<td>贷（CR）</td>\n<td>借（DR）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收入</td>\n<td>贷（CR）</td>\n<td>借（DR）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>费用</td>\n<td>借（DR）</td>\n<td>贷（CR）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>用这套规则重写刚才的例子。用户支付 100 元，资金进入平台银行账户，平台应收 1 元手续费：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>银行存款（资产）增加 99 元 → 借 99</li>\n<li>应付商户款（负债）增加 99 元 → 贷 99</li>\n<li>银行存款（资产）增加 1 元 → 借 1</li>\n<li>手续费收入（收入）增加 1 元 → 贷 1</li>\n</ul>\n<p>合并后：借 银行存款 100，贷 应付商户款 99，贷 手续费收入 1。借贷各 100，平衡。这样记的好处是，券商的每一分钱从哪来、到哪去都能在科目余额表上看到，而不像 <code>UPDATE balance - 100</code> 那样只剩一个净额。</p>\n<p>工程实现上，<strong>不要让调用方直接传 <code>DR</code>/<code>CR</code> 字符</strong>。传方向等于把&quot;符号约定&quot;这个易错点暴露给每个上游业务方，一定会有业务方在退款场景把方向写反。推荐的做法是按&quot;账户类型 + 金额符号&quot;推导方向：内部记账服务提供 <code>credit(account, amount)</code> / <code>debit(account, amount)</code> 两个语义化方法，由账户上的 <code>normal_side</code> 决定落库时写成什么方向，业务方只需表达&quot;这个账户的钱变多了还是变少了&quot;。这个封装把方向错误从&quot;每个业务方各自的 bug&quot;收敛成&quot;记账服务一处需要测试的逻辑&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"推导函数的标准形式\">推导函数的标准形式</h3><p>推导逻辑本身只有几行，但要写成纯函数并集中在一处：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Element = &#39;ASSET&#39; | &#39;LIABILITY&#39; | &#39;EQUITY&#39; | &#39;REVENUE&#39; | &#39;EXPENSE&#39;;&#10;type Side = &#39;DR&#39; | &#39;CR&#39;;&#10;&#10;function resolveDirection(element: Element, delta: &#39;increase&#39; | &#39;decrease&#39;): Side {&#10;  const debitNormal = element === &#39;ASSET&#39; || element === &#39;EXPENSE&#39;;&#10;  const increasesByDebit = debitNormal ? delta === &#39;increase&#39; : delta === &#39;decrease&#39;;&#10;  return increasesByDebit ? &#39;DR&#39; : &#39;CR&#39;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Element</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ASSET'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'LIABILITY'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'EQUITY'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'REVENUE'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'EXPENSE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Side</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DR'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resolveDirection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">element</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Element</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">delta</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'increase'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'decrease'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Side</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> debitNormal</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> element </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ASSET'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> element </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'EXPENSE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> increasesByDebit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> debitNormal </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'increase'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'decrease'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> increasesByDebit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DR'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>只有四行判断，但把它放在一个有单元测试的纯函数里，就让&quot;方向写反&quot;从一类线上事故退化成一个在 CI 就能捕获的回归。</p>\n<p>关于分录本身的结构、行与头的关系、以及平衡校验该在哪个层次执行，见 <a href=\"../double-entry-posting/debit-credit-balanced-entry\">借贷分录与平衡校验</a>。本章的职责到此为止：确定有哪些账户、每个账户的语义与正常方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p><strong>科目与账户分离</strong>是本节最重要的结论。科目承载会计语义（要素、正常方向、报表归属），账户承载记账主体（谁的钱、在哪个环节）。合并成一张表在单主体场景能跑，在&quot;万级商户各有一个应付户&quot;时必然崩溃。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>五个会计要素决定借贷方向，判定捷径是会计恒等式：资产 + 费用 = 负债 + 所有者权益 + 收入。</li>\n<li>用户余额属于<strong>负债</strong>不是资产，把代收资金记成资产会把别人的钱算成自己的收入。</li>\n<li>科目编码分段设计可让报表聚合走前缀索引，但要额外保留 <code>parent_code</code> 以支持科目重组而不动历史分录。</li>\n<li>平台内部账户（清算在途、手续费收入、应付商户款、自有资金）是表达&quot;资金流转时间差&quot;的必要工具，不是可有可无的中间科目。</li>\n<li>金额一律以最小币种的整数（minor units）存储，方向由记账服务按账户 <code>normal_side</code> 推导，不让业务方直接传 <code>DR</code>/<code>CR</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>账户确定后，下一个问题是每个账户里同时存哪些数字——单一数量不够，多币种场景需要双金额，冻结场景需要多维度余额，见 <a href=\"multi-currency-account-balance\">多币种账户与余额</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内部账户与科目体系","id":"内部账户与科目体系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：五个会计要素与借贷方向","id":"核心概念-五个会计要素与借贷方向"},{"level":3,"text":"借贷不是借出借入","id":"借贷不是借出借入"},{"level":3,"text":"恒等式为什么必然成立","id":"恒等式为什么必然成立"},{"level":2,"text":"科目编码与科目树","id":"科目编码与科目树"},{"level":3,"text":"分段编码的三个好处","id":"分段编码的三个好处"},{"level":3,"text":"科目表的 DDL","id":"科目表的-ddl"},{"level":2,"text":"平台内部账户清单","id":"平台内部账户清单"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么必须有内部账户","id":"为什么必须有内部账户"},{"level":3,"text":"一组完整分录的落库形式","id":"一组完整分录的落库形式"},{"level":2,"text":"一个账户里的借贷方向如何确定","id":"一个账户里的借贷方向如何确定"},{"level":3,"text":"四种组合穷尽","id":"四种组合穷尽"},{"level":3,"text":"推导函数的标准形式","id":"推导函数的标准形式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"多币种账户与余额","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/double-entry-ledger-platform/account-chart-model/multi-currency-account-balance"}}